{"type":"text","timestamp":1790444958245,"sessionID":"ses_f212d3ba9ffeyO8eKKCixip51E","part":{"id":"prt_0ded5f217001jLjgZAg4FnE79I","messageID":"msg_0ded528a3001iOprAAlsdqFCBo","sessionID":"ses_f212d3ba9ffeyO8eKKCixip51E","type":"text","text":"The direction sign is inverted — `-forward` in Godot (where node forward is `-basis.z`) means `+basis.z`, and the 0.3 impulse is clamped by the existing `camera_shake_max_power = 0.15`. Fixing the direction:","time":{"start":1790444958231,"end":1790444958236},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_7ec1b78b7f124f3bbadf7a8326b7326c_msg"}}}}
